# Step-by-Step Deployment Plan for Python & Gen AI Learning Platform

This document provides a clear, step-by-step deployment guide to deploy this website (**Full-Stack React + Node.js Express API**) to your Oracle Cloud / Ubuntu Linux VM.

All 16+ notebook lesson folders have been added to `.gitignore` so your GitHub repository remains lightweight and focused purely on the Web Application code.

